### =========================================================================
### SEARCH SERVICE HTTP TEST SUITE (P3)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7000

### 1. Health Check & Operational Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status

### 2. Get Available Search Filters (Languages & Years)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/filters

### =========================================================================
### SEARCH TESTS (`GET /search`)
### =========================================================================

### 3. Basic Keyword Search (Mandatory parameter 'q')
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure

### 4. Search with Individual Filter (Language = English)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=love&language=en

### 5. Search with Individual Filter (Author substring case-insensitive = austen)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=pride&author=austen

### 6. Search with Individual Filter (Publication Year = 1813)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=prejudice&year=1813

### 7. Search with Combined Filters (Author, Language, and Year)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=love&author=austen&language=en&year=1813

### 8. Search with Pagination (Offset 0, Limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=the&offset=0&limit=5

### 9. Search with Pagination (Offset 5, Limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=the&offset=5&limit=5

### 10. Search with No Results (Returns 200 OK with empty results array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=nonexistentterm123456789

### =========================================================================
### ERROR HANDLING VALIDATION TESTS (Expected 400 Bad Request)
### =========================================================================

### 11. Error: Missing mandatory 'q' parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/search

### 12. Error: Malformed limit parameter (limit = -1, out of bounds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&limit=-1

### 13. Error: Malformed limit parameter (limit = 200, exceeds max 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&limit=200

### 14. Error: Malformed year parameter (year = abc, not an integer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&year=abc

### 15. Error: Malformed offset parameter (offset = xyz, not an integer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&offset=xyz

### =========================================================================
### BOOK METADATA TESTS (`GET /books/{id}`)
### =========================================================================

### 16. Get Book Metadata by ID (Existing Book - Pride and Prejudice ID 1342)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1342

### 17. Get Book Metadata by ID (Non-existent Book - Expected 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/99999999